# Configuration for the Dropbear SSH server.
#
# This file is sourced by Buildroot's /etc/init.d/S50dropbear at boot; the
# contents of DROPBEAR_ARGS are appended to the dropbear command line.
#
# Root login policy for the PiSonic appliance:
#   * The generic image has a locked root account and SSH is disabled.
#   * Explicit root_password= provisioning unlocks root and persists only its
#     hash. S50dropbear independently requires that persisted, unlocked hash.
#   * Password authentication is then allowed on the trusted LAN; Dropbear is
#     not passed -s or -g.
#
# NOTE: the init script disables this service by default. If SSH is explicitly
# enabled, use the unique provisioned password only on a trusted network.
#
# -p 22   : listen on the standard SSH port.
DROPBEAR_ARGS="-p 22"
